## 用法

### Stream Markdown
::::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="StreamMarkdownStreamMarkdownDemo" code-lang="vue"}
---
code: |
  <script setup lang="ts">
  import TxMermaidBlock from '@talex-touch/tuffex/stream-markdown'

  const content = ref('# 标题\n\n正在生成…')
  </script>

  <template>
    <TxStreamMarkdown
      :content="content"
      streaming
      :renderers="{ mermaid: TxMermaidBlock }"
    />
  </template>
---
